{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/984897-topical-turning-real-events-into-wod-events","id":984897,"title":"Topical!: Turning Real Events into WoD events","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-10T08:45:37-07:00","id":984897,"title":"Topical!: Turning Real Events into WoD events","content":"The idea is to take some real news and turn it into a WoD event or element for inspiration. obviously avoiding certain subjects that might be too controversial such as politics<br /> I been curious about all this Clown Attacks on some areas of USA. i been thinking about inserting some of them as a new breed of Bane or something similar. still thinking about the stats or should i keep them as Gore Hounds?.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T20:00:15-07:00","id":985228,"title":"","content":"I generally shy away from giving real world events supernatural causes, but I do enjoy speculating about the implications real world events have for supernatural affairs.<br /> <br /> For example: the increased migration from the Middle East to Europe and the United States over the last fifteen years has also been bringing with it a growing number of Kindred from the region. Not just your stereotypical Assamites and Setites, but all sorts. Toreador, Malkavians, Gangrel, even some Ventrue. It hasn't caused much ruckus so far, most of them being more concerned with survival than politics, but even without any troublemakers that many new faces in such a short period of time is going to shake up the status quo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T05:26:16-07:00","id":985359,"title":"","content":"In the real events some real people can suffer. We have to respect them. How would you feel if you lose family in a terrorist attack in a church, and later you watch a movie where something like that happens?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T06:38:02-07:00","id":985382,"title":"","content":"I think that you can respect the suffering of real people by using real world events in our games. And, quite frankly, it happens all of the time in fiction. Do we avoid games that is set in World War Two because of the Holocaust? No, we play games that are set in World War Two because we want to play the good guy and, quite frankly, we can deal with the horror of World War Two through our games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T07:26:52-07:00","id":985403,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't set a Werewolf Session at the Dakota Access Pipeline, but I would certainly consider running an Amazon Access Pipeline with similar sorts of events.<br /> <br /> The interesting thing about the Clowns are that it's an emergent phenomenon. It could be BSDs, Nosferatu, Gangers on PCP...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T08:38:28-07:00","id":985440,"title":"","content":"personally i avoid things like Terrorism on my games (except when the news are talking about mages going apeshit or hunters on killingsprees).<br /> i was thinking about more &quot;serial killer&quot; news or weird real events such as the Clowns","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T16:27:04-07:00","id":985766,"title":"","content":"I think it depends on the sensibilities and sensitivities of the people you game with. Incorporating real world elements can either seem insensitive to real world victims and/or come off as beating people over the head with some sort of political issue. For some groups, those things can be alright, for others not so much. So the degree of controversy a game can handle depends on what players are alright with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T23:04:17-07:00","id":985958,"title":"","content":"so IRL they keep dredging up loot from the Queen Anne's Revenge off the coast of NC. after reading about the latest finds i decided since my game is set in a fictitious town off the coast there that the local changelings hold Pirate Parties every time new discoveries are made feeding off it and generally going librarian poo and its become a irritation to the local technocrats. they attempted to loose a nanobot swarm to destroy most of the remaining debris of the ship to short circuit the future of the party scene. the players got wind of this and were doing a pretty good job of disasembling the technos operation until blackbeards actual wraith came with dead friends to kick around the bastards messing with his fetters. i decided if a ghost can possess a computer it could try to grab a nanoswarm and everything got crazy for a few rounds as a pillar of gray goo rose from the sea and charged the coast. fortunately the technocrats were using a storm to both power and cover the nanotech activity so witnesses were down to a few drunks. i use a lot of google maps for our games and found that the wreck is really close to an old fort (which even has a few pokestops that the party used to manipulate a crowd of sleeper partygoers to maneuver them to different parts of the fort. <br /> it dont always have to be political ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>there are no bad ideas, just ideas that have not been refined enough","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1608-iamthesweeper","name":"IAmTheSweeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T01:05:49-07:00","id":985991,"title":"","content":"I've been meaning to start a thread devoted to all the scientific advances and technological innovations made lately, that would almost certainly expand the reach and powers of the Technocracy and/or technomancer Traditions.<br /> <br /> For one, you have the folks over at <a href=\"http://www.openbionics.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Open Bionics</a> who not only create affordable (comparatively) prosthetic arms, but have even developed ones that can be 3D printed. Suddenly, bionic arms become a lot more common. And, therefore, Coincidental.<br /> <br /> Or how about Facebook's plans to use solar powered, self-piloting planes to provide wifi to areas of the world otherwise without the infrastructure to support it. While this is good for humanitarian purposes (and potentially benefiting Facebook financially, which could make some Syndicate reps very happy), it also means that there's yet more ability for the Technocracy to connect the world. Thereby pushing back the borders of Reality Zones hostile to Science and beneficial to mysticism even more. There are even fewer places where a Technocrat could connect to using Data...though that's also true of the Virtual Adepts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}